"i": 429,
"where": "スライド20",
"en": "MS also supports other conventions such as \"fastcall\" which passes first 2 params in EDX, ECX, and then the rest on the stack",
"ja": ""
},
{
"i": 430,
"where": "スライド20",
"en": "It's like a more limited version of the x86-64 calling convention",
"ja": ""
},
{
"i": 431,
"where": "スライド20",
"en": "No use of stack frames (since that's extra overhead, which would make it less fast!)",
"ja": ""
},
